ll/118598.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-25T13:37:19Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14633\r\n\r\nThe GDScript LSP currently strips `[color]` BBCode tags when converting documentation to Markdown, since Markdown has no equivalent. This PR preserves it for capable clients by converting `[color=...]` to `<span style=\"color:...\">`, but only if the client declares support for it.\r\n\r\nSpecifically, conversion is applied only when `\"span\"` is included in `general.markdown.allowedTags`:\r\nhttps://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#markdownClientCapabilities\r\n\r\nClients that do not advertise this capability are unaffected, and the existing stripping behavior is preserved.\r\n\r\nTested with Rider (via https://github.com/JetBrains/godot-support/commit/476f5d36bef9f2e33c7830ff83d60179ccbaaa28), and verified that VS Code, Zed, and Vim clients are unaffected.\r\n\r\nAI disclaimer: the original proof-of-concept in the proposal was written by AI, whilst this PR was written by hand.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118598/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118598/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}